  "chat.sp.jack.intro": "Happy Halloween!\nI am Jack, the Czar of Halloween!\nTonight is a very special, spooky night...\nLet's make it frightfully fun!",
  "chat.sp.jack.ask": "Now then... trick or treat!\nNo candy, and you'll get a trick!",
  "chat.sp.jack.thanks": "Ooh! Candy!\nThe sweetest joy of Halloween! Thank you!",
  "chat.sp.jack.trick": "What... nothing at all?\nThen it's a trick! Heh heh heh...!",
  "chat.sp.jack.0": "The sweetness of candy is tonight's magic...",
  "chat.sp.jack.1": "Dressing up as a ghost is half the fun of Halloween!",
  "chat.sp.jack.2": "The pumpkin lanterns are glowing just right.",
  "chat.sp.jack.3": "Let's meet again next Halloween!",
